      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    loan_amount = 300_000\n    original_rate = 0.045\n    new_rate = 0.04\n    loan_term_years = 30\n    float_down_fee_percent = 0.4\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    def monthly_payment(annual_rate):\n        monthly_rate = annual_rate / 12\n        return loan_amount * monthly_rate / (1 - (1 + monthly_rate) ** -total_payments)\n\n    payment_savings = (\n        monthly_payment(original_rate) - monthly_payment(new_rate)\n    ) * total_payments\n    fee = loan_amount * float_down_fee_percent / 100\n    answer = round(payment_savings - fee)\n\n    # Return answer\n    return answer\n```",
